  (text "ROUTING - MODULE\nC1/C2 right at pad 2. R1/C3 short to EN. R4 at GPIO2; R5/R6 at GPIO13/14, then 90R pair to J1.\nModule EPAD soldered to GND with vias for heat."
    (at 119.38 218.44 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 255 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "16e3cb06-ae8d-408a-a0a0-4bea123f795a")
  )
  (text "EN RESET"
    (at 113.03 87.63 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ae26e807-d35d-4219-8678-93f7701963e6")
  )
  (text "USB R, UART0"
    (at 238.76 110.49 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "1661b5a7-7116-494d-86ea-4b6453ddec6f")
  )
  (text "BOOT GPIO28"
    (at 285.75 121.92 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "2750809c-0e2d-4248-bf02-fd8baef2bfd0")
  )
  (text "STATUS LED"
    (at 238.76 146.05 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6290bcca-d88b-4772-b693-eca104a20b0c")
  )
  (text "ESP32-C5-WROOM-1U-N8R8 (ESP-Hosted SPI full-duplex slave)\nCLK GPIO6, MOSI GPIO7, MISO GPIO2, CS GPIO10, HANDSHAKE GPIO3, DATA_READY GPIO4, reset = EN.\nESP-Hosted's C5 Kconfig defaults are CLK GPIO3 and HANDSHAKE GPIO1: set these two in menuconfig.\nGPIO2/3/7 are strapping pins, but boot mode is set only by GPIO26-28.\nEN: 10k/1uF delay, host reset via R2. BOOT on GPIO28. Status LED on GPIO24. Pad 19 is PSRAM CS: NC.\nAntenna: Taoglas FXP831 on the U.FL connector; its 5GHz gain exceeds the certified limit (C1).\nDESIGN_NOTES.md §3."
    (at 119.38 203.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f15d6460-b28b-4533-8439-2f750fb575c3")
  )
